Take the wands of teleportation out of your bag and teleport the kirin
away to lessen the summoning.  Kill the cockatrice an L-step away from
you and hope it leaves a corpse.  Grab the corpse if there is one, and
get into a position to teleport the titan away.

If there was a corpse, disposing the enemies shouldn't be too
difficult.  If not, you in heap big trouble.  Mix beating up things
with healing and edging towards the portal.  The steam vortex below
you is your friend.  Just sit inside and heal up.  Don't forget to use
the potion of full healing in your bag, and place a new amulet of life
saving after the current crumbles.

And some random comments:

You might consider breaking wands.  Teleportation will teleport any
adjacent monsters, but you only have 3 of them, so choose when to do
so wisely.  Probably break digging first; they are useless now.

There are lots of dragons around you.  Try to use their breath attacks
to help kill monsters.  Disintegration breaths are very good, but I
can't see any black dragons.  Green dragons will breathe poison, which
may cause instant death to non-poison-resistant enemies.

Remember to pray when on very low HP!

Having no levitation will make this hard, since sometimes you won't
move.  I remember someone crossing the plane by hurling junk in the
opposite direction of travel.  I think it stuns you for several turns
afterwards, but I'm not sure.  This might be the fastest way to cross.

